    {
      "text": "ZPC supports creating custom security policies to expand security coverage to your cloud infrastructure beyond the 300+ predefined security policies."
    },
    {
      "text": "ZPC offers custom security policies so that you can secure your cloud deployment:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Add a new custom security policy to an existing protected asset. For example, you can create a custom security policy to control the configuration of a new feature released by your cloud service provider on an existing asset type.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Add a new custom security policy to asset types that currently do not have predefined security policies. For example, you can create custom security policies to protect a completely new service offered by your cloud service provider.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "To create a custom security policy:"
    },
    {
      "item": "1. Provide general information.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the left pane menu, select Policies.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          30,
          38
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Create Policy.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select your Cloud Type.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          12,
          22
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Under Focus on, select either Assets or Identities.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          14
        ],
        [
          30,
          36
        ],
        [
          40,
          50
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Next.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "2. Build a query.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
